  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A forest plot of percentage agreement between TBST and TST in children with active TB, by test pair: DST AI vs TST5mm 97.04% (three studies) and DST 5mm vs TST 5mm 98.85% (one study). The overall random-effects pooled agreement is 97.39% (96.39–98.12) across 1342 participants.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "مخطط شجري لنسبة التوافق بين اختبارات TBST وTST لدى الأطفال المصابين بالسل النشط، حسب زوج الاختبارات: DST AI مقابل TST 5 مم 97.04% (ثلاث دراسات)، وDST 5 مم مقابل TST 5 مم 98.85% (دراسة واحدة). ويبلغ التوافق المجمّع الإجمالي 97.39% (96.39–98.12) لدى 1342 مشاركاً.",
